(This contract implements a quantum-safe access control system using ML-DSA-87 signatures via QoreChain's) Tj
T* (post-quantum precompiles. The implementation correctly separates quantum-safe signature verification from) Tj
T* (traditional Ethereum access control. Key strengths include proper nonce management, domain separation for) Tj
T* (signatures, and clear separation of concerns between admin, user, and referee roles. However, the contract lacks) Tj
T* (ML-KEM implementation for complete post-quantum security and has some minor reentrancy risks in external calls.) Tj
T* (The code quality is generally good with clear documentation and logical separation of concerns.) Tj
